#
# Copy to `never_upvote.txt` (gitignored) and edit. One username per line.
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored; a leading `@` is stripped;
# matching is case-insensitive. Re-read automatically on change — no
# restart needed, even in webhook mode.
#
# This list only suppresses upvotes. To also stop downvotes, add the same
# name to `never_downvote.txt`.

